    "fileId": 18929,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Chondroblastic osteosarcoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "There is more variation in cellularity in chondroblastic osteosarcoma than in childhood chondrosarcoma, and the presence of osteoid production essentially confirms the diagnosis.",
